"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletownwoodlandslobby_walkandtalk",
"en": "[this just needs to be an edit of 357294116] Some of the Fables don't like me."
},
{
"k": "10683",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletownwoodlandslobby_walkandtalk",
"en": "Myself?"
},
{
"k": "10684",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletownwoodlandslobby_walkandtalk",
"en": "[pickup2][angry]{AngryB}And that makes it okay?"
},
{
"k": "10685",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletownwoodlandslobby_walkandtalk",
"en": "[pickup][still angry]And did he?"
},
{
"k": "10686",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletownwoodlandslobby_walkandtalk",
"en": "[pickup]Not about you… or.  Her.  The murder."
},
{
"k": "10687",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletownwoodlandslobby_walkandtalk",
"en": "[pickup]No.  Not about you, anyway.  Or… her.  The murder."
},
{
"k": "10688",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletownwoodlandslobby_walkandtalk",
"en": "Where the hell have you been?"
},
{
"k": "10689",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletownwoodlandslobby_walkandtalk",
"en": "I was doing my job."
},
{
"k": "10690",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletownwoodlandslobby_walkandtalk",
"en": "You really scared us."
},
{
"k": "10691",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletownwoodlandslobby_walkandtalk",
"en": "[pickup2] [tense, worried] {WorriedA}Where the hell have you been all night, Snow?"
},
{
"k": "10692",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletownwoodlandslobby_walkandtalk",
"en": "Why would you go off off alone?"
},
{
"k": "10693",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletownwoodlandslobby_walkandtalk",
"en": "You were at the Trip Trap.  I couldn't find anyone else."
},
{
"k": "10694",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletownwoodlandslobby_walkandtalk",
"en": "[pickup2] [tense, worried] {WorriedA}You really scared us. If we'd just known you weren't actually dead…"
},
{
"k": "10695",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletownwoodlandslobby_walkandtalk",
"en": "[pickup]I-- didn't do anything!  You all ran off in a panic.  No one even bothered to check if it was really me!"
},
{
"k": "10696",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletownwoodlandslobby_walkandtalk",
"en": "[pickup]And I'm supposed to believe you couldn't?  Come on, Bigby."
},
{
"k": "10697",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletownwoodlandslobby_walkandtalk",
"en": "[pickup2] [defensive, angry] {AngryA}I was just doing my job."
},
{
"k": "10698",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletownwoodlandslobby_walkandtalk",
"en": "Bigby, I get it.  But it wasn't me."
},
{
"k": "10699",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletownwoodlandslobby_walkandtalk",
"en": "You don't know me, Bigby."
},
{
"k": "10700",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletownwoodlandslobby_walkandtalk",
"en": "I wouldn't expect you to understand."
},
{
"k": "10701",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletownwoodlandslobby_walkandtalk",
"en": "It looked like a bunch of schoolyard thugs.  I thought you were smarter."
},
{
"k": "10702",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletownwoodlandslobby_walkandtalk",
"en": "[pickup][sad]Shit."
},
{
"k": "10703",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletownwoodlandslobby_walkandtalk",
"en": "[pickup2] [angry] {AngryB}Bufkin told me about Grendel's arm."
},
{
"k": "10704",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletownwoodlandslobby_walkandtalk",
"en": "[pickup2] [angry] {AngryA}Bufkin told me what happened at the Trip Trap."
},
{
"k": "10705",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletownwoodlandslobby_walkandtalk",
"en": "[pickup]I was actually holding back.  Not that it matters."
},
{
"k": "10706",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletownwoodlandslobby_walkandtalk",
"en": "[pickup]It does."
},
{
"k": "10707",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletownwoodlandslobby_walkandtalk",
"en": "How are you not dead?"
},
{
"k": "10708",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletownwoodlandslobby_walkandtalk",
"en": "[pickup]Let's just focus on what we need to do here.  Tell me how exactly you found the body."
},
{
"k": "10709",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletownwoodlandslobby_walkandtalk",
"en": "[pickup2] [annoyed][emphasize \"I\"] I was working on this case."
},
{
"k": "10710",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletownwoodlandslobby_walkandtalk",
"en": "[pickup]Sorry…"
},
{
"k": "10711",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletownwoodlandslobby_walkandtalk",
"en": "[pickup]I wasn't feeling exactly rational, Snow."
},
{
"k": "10712",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletownwoodlandslobby_walkandtalk",
"en": "I'll figure it out."
},
{
"k": "10713",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletownwoodlandslobby_walkandtalk",
"en": "[pickup2] [angry] {AngryB}Oh, that's your job? Beating up people?"
},
{
"k": "10714",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletownwoodlandslobby_walkandtalk",
"en": "[pickup2] [tense] {AngryB}Getting answers."
},
{
"k": "10715",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletownwoodlandslobby_walkandtalk",
"en": "[pickup2] [tense, trying to change the subject] {WorriedA}So you found the victim… {DoubtfulA}the real one."
},
{
"k": "10716",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletownwoodlandslobby_walkandtalk",
"en": "[pickup2] {NormalA}We just keep doing what we've been doing."
},
{
"k": "10717",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletownwoodlandslobby_walkandtalk",
"en": "[pickup2] {AngryA}We do our jobs."
},
{
"k": "10718",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletownwoodlandslobby_walkandtalk",
"en": "[pickup2] I just feel like…"
},
{
"k": "10719",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletownwoodlandslobby_walkandtalk",
"en": "[pickup2] [You can't be serious] Too dangerous?! Bigby- [too frustrated to continue]"
},
{
"k": "10720",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletownwoodlandslobby_walkandtalk",
"en": "[pickup2][annoyed]{AngryA}I could ask you the same question, but I already know the answer."
},
{
"k": "10721",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletownwoodlandslobby_walkandtalk",
"en": "[pickup2][tense] And why she was glamoured to look like me…"
},
{
"k": "10722",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletownwoodlandslobby_walkandtalk",
"en": "[pickup2][tense] I mean, that's what it is, right?"
},
{
"k": "10723",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletownwoodlandslobby_walkandtalk",
"en": "I told you, {AngryA}I'm tired of sitting around!"
},
{
"k": "10724",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletownwoodlandslobby_walkandtalk",
"en": "You've got it wrong."
},
{
"k": "10725",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "I'm looking for Vivian."
},
{
"k": "10726",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "What happened to you?"
},
{
"k": "10727",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "Hello, Jack. I'm looking for someone called Vivian, have you seen her?"
},
{
"k": "10728",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "[nose-bleed pinched]I don't know who that is."
},
{
"k": "10729",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "Let me guess: dissatisfied customer?"
},
{
"k": "10730",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "Jack Horner! What a surprise."
},
{
"k": "10731",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "[nose-bleed pinched]Fuck you, Bigby."
},
{
"k": "10732",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "[nose-bleed pinched]Bleeding."
},
{
"k": "10733",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "[nose-bleed pinched]The counter girl is-- oh, it's you."
},
{
"k": "10734",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "[tentatively sniffs twice]"
},
{
"k": "10735",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "Somebody call you? I wish you'd gotten here ten minutes ago."
},
{
"k": "10736",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "I was minding my own business, having a bit of fun with Fiorita upstairs, and all of a sudden fucking BEAST breaks down the door and comes charging in yelling about Beauty! We weren't bothering anybody."
},
{
"k": "10737",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "[tell me more now]Oh?"
},
{
"k": "10738",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "I'm tired of you assholes shoving me around! I want him arrested or I'm going to Crane and have you BOTH thrown in jail for assault."
},
{
"k": "10739",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "I want that asshole arrested for assault!"
},
{
"k": "10740",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "You probably deserved it."
},
{
"k": "10741",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "I'll arrest him."
},
{
"k": "10742",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "I have more pressing business."
},
{
"k": "10743",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "You didn't provoke him? Who took the first swing?"
},
{
"k": "10744",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "It was Beast who broke into MY room.  I'm in the right."
},
{
"k": "10745",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "Fine. I'll arrest him next time I see him."
},
{
"k": "10746",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "Don't bother me with this crap, Jack. I'm investigating a murder."
},
{
"k": "10747",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "[muttering]…fucking taking this to Crane…"
},
{
"k": "10748",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "[it's you]Beauty!"
},
{
"k": "10749",
"who": "BEAUTY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "No, don't! This is all my fault. He was just looking for me."
},
{
"k": "10750",
"who": "BEAUTY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "Here, I brought you a-- oh! Bigby!"
},
{
"k": "10751",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "Are you two having an affair?"
},
{
"k": "10752",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "I thought I saw you come here."
},
{
"k": "10753",
"who": "BEAUTY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "[guiltily]I'm working here."
},
{
"k": "10754",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "Are the two of you…"
},
{
"k": "10755",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "No, you idiot. She works here now."
},
{
"k": "10756",
"who": "BEAUTY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "[guiltily]I was hoping you didn't recognize me. I guess that was stupid. Anyway…"
},
{
"k": "10757",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "[confirming what happened earlier]I thought I saw you coming in here."
},
{
"k": "10758",
"who": "BEAUTY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "[guiltily]I guess I should explain myself."
},
{
"k": "10759",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "This neighborhood isn't exactly the safest. Someone was killed on this block last night."
},
{
"k": "10760",
"who": "BEAUTY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "[embarrassed]I borrowed a little money and I needed a way to pay it back.  They needed a desk clerk, so…"
},
{
"k": "10761",
"who": "BEAUTY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "[weakly, to Jack]Here, put this on your lip."
},
{
"k": "10762",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "[putting cold pack on lip]Fangks."
},
{
"k": "10763",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "[ice pack on lip]How'd it go with the glamour you fucking stole from me?"
},
{
"k": "10764",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "Got the job done."
},
{
"k": "10765",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "Glamour failed."
},
{
"k": "10766",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "STUB: It was educational."
},
{
"k": "10767",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "[ice pack on lip]I don't suppose you got your hands on that little item I mentioned? At the police station?"
},
{
"k": "10768",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "The glamour failed."
},
{
"k": "10769",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "Your two-bit glamour dropped out on me. We're damn lucky no one saw it happen."
},
{
"k": "10770",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "[ice pack on lip]It would work right if you used it right."
},
{
"k": "10771",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "I took care of it."
},
{
"k": "10772",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "[ice pack on lip]Fantastic! You're the best."
},
{
"k": "10773",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "[ice pack on lip]Well, looks like you are good for something after all."
},
{
"k": "10774",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "[ice pack on lip]Where is it? Lemme have it."
},
{
"k": "10775",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "[Give it to him]"
},
{
"k": "10776",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "I'll hang on to it."
},
{
"k": "10777",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "I don't have it with me."
},
{
"k": "10778",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "[not fine]Fine."
},
{
"k": "10779",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "What is that thing, anyway?"
},
{
"k": "10780",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "A goldmine. The mundys have got these bank machines now that they trust to hand out money."
},
{
"k": "10781",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "I'm sorry I asked."
},
{
"k": "10782",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "I'll hang on to it. Wouldn't want it getting into the wrong hands."
},
{
"k": "10783",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "Might as well have left it with the cops."
},
{
"k": "10784",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "I didn't bring it with me."
},
{
"k": "10785",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "[ice pack on lip]Hnh."
},
{
"k": "10786",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "Hoo-rah for me."
},
{
"k": "10787",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "Mission accomplished. You helped avert what could have been a pretty bad situation."
},
{
"k": "10788",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "No, I didn't."
},
{
"k": "10789",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "[to Beauty]Thanks for the ice pack."
},
{
"k": "10790",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "See that I'm not disturbed, OK?"
},
{
"k": "10791",
"who": "JACK",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "No tip, I hope you understand."
},
{
"k": "10792",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "Is Vivian here? I need to speak to her. And to you, too."
},
{
"k": "10793",
"who": "BEAUTY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "[quavering]Listen, Bigby, I have a confession… That woman, the one I found at the Woodlands. I lied, I did recognize her. I don't know her name, but I've seen her around."
},
{
"k": "10794",
"who": "BEAUTY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "[halting]I didn't want anyone to know I was working here…"
},
{
"k": "10795",
"who": "BEAUTY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "[halting]…not even you."
},
{
"k": "10796",
"who": "BEAUTY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "[halting]…because Beast…"
},
{
"k": "10797",
"who": "BEAUTY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "[sadder]…then that second woman died…"
},
{
"k": "10798",
"who": "BEAUTY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "[more upset]…and it could have been Snow…"
},
{
"k": "10799",
"who": "BEAUTY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "[about to cry]…and all the time I was just thinking…"
},
{
"k": "10800",
"who": "BEAUTY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "[about to cry]…I could have…"
},
{
"k": "10801",
"who": "BEAUTY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "[about to cry]…what if…"
},
{
"k": "10802",
"who": "BEAUTY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "[really about to cry]…what if…"
},
{
"k": "10803",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "It's OK."
},
{
"k": "10804",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "Should have told me earlier!"
},
{
"k": "10805",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "What else are you hiding?"
},
{
"k": "10806",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "It's all right. I understand."
},
{
"k": "10807",
"who": "BEAUTY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "[chokes, almost cries]"
},
{
"k": "10808",
"who": "BEAUTY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "[sniff]"
},
{
"k": "10809",
"who": "BEAUTY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "[deep breath in and out]"
},
{
"k": "10810",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "[stern]You should have told me sooner! This is more serious than whatever games you're playing with your husband!"
},
{
"k": "10811",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "[disgusted]What else are you hiding?"
},
{
"k": "10812",
"who": "BEAUTY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "[about to cry]No, nothing!"
},
{
"k": "10813",
"who": "BEAUTY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "[quietly, crying a little]It's my fault. What happened to the second woman. Isn't it."
},
{
"k": "10814",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "If you had told me…"
},
{
"k": "10815",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "Don't blame yourself."
},
{
"k": "10816",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "Pull yourself together."
},
{
"k": "10817",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "If you had told me before, maybe I could have…"
},
{
"k": "10818",
"who": "BEAUTY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "[crying openly for a few moments]"
},
{
"k": "10819",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "You can't blame yourself for this. The one who's to blame is the one who killed them. Not you."
},
{
"k": "10820",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "You've got to pull yourself together."
},
{
"k": "10821",
"who": "BEAUTY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "[crying very quietly, hands on face]"
},
{
"k": "10822",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "Can I get you something?"
},
{
"k": "10823",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "I need to ask you some questions."
},
{
"k": "10824",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "Can I get you a glass of water or something?"
},
{
"k": "10825",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "Look, uh, I have to ask you something, okay?"
},
{
"k": "10826",
"who": "BEAUTY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "Bigby… I'd like you to give me your word on something."
},
{
"k": "10827",
"who": "BEAUTY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "That you won't tell Beast you found me here."
},
{
"k": "10828",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "On what?"
},
{
"k": "10829",
"who": "BEAUTY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "He suspects, but he didn't see me."
},
{
"k": "10830",
"who": "BEAUTY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "He's already got too much… he does too much."
},
{
"k": "10831",
"who": "BEAUTY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "For me to be working here…"
},
{
"k": "10832",
"who": "BEAUTY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "But I need to deal with my own problem without involving him."
},
{
"k": "10833",
"who": "BEAUTY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "He wouldn't like it that I'm even in the neighborhood."
},
{
"k": "10834",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "Did you see anyone with Faith?"
},
{
"k": "10835",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "Did you see a troll?"
},
{
"k": "10836",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "Did you see Snow White?"
},
{
"k": "10837",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "Where is Vivian?"
},
{
"k": "10838",
"who": "BEAUTY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "[post cry]Nobody I recognized. There was one really ugly man, he looked like he'd been in a terrible accident or something."
},
{
"k": "10839",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "Did you ever see anyone with Faith? That's the first woman, the one you…"
},
{
"k": "10840",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "Have you seen a troll around? In the hotel, anywhere else?"
},
{
"k": "10841",
"who": "BEAUTY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "[post cry]No. But wouldn't they have to be in glamour?"
},
{
"k": "10842",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "Normally, yes."
},
{
"k": "10843",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "Have you ever seen Snow White around here?"
},
{
"k": "10844",
"who": "BEAUTY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "[post cry]No. It doesn't seem like her kind of-- oh, I see. No."
},
{
"k": "10845",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "I need to talk to Vivian. Do you know where she is?"
},
{
"k": "10846",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "You have my word."
},
{
"k": "10847",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "No promises."
},
{
"k": "10848",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "I think it's a little late for that."
},
{
"k": "10849",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "OK. You have my word."
},
{
"k": "10850",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "I'm not going to promise you that."
},
{
"k": "10851",
"who": "BEAUTY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "[disappointed]I see."
},
{
"k": "10852",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "It's a little late for that, don't you think?"
},
{
"k": "10853",
"who": "BEAUTY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "[disappointed]I don't know."
},
{
"k": "10854",
"who": "BEAUTY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "[getting sad again]Vivian is… she's probably… they're having a funeral.  She would be there."
},
{
"k": "10855",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "Mm hm."
},
{
"k": "10856",
"who": "BEAUTY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "[sad]When you get there… pay my respects? I can't, I just can't…"
},
{
"k": "10857",
"who": "BEAUTY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "[sad]Oh, what am I going to do?"
},
{
"k": "10858",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "Go home."
},
{
"k": "10859",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "Stay and watch for anything suspicious."
},
{
"k": "10860",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "I can't answer for you."
},
{
"k": "10861",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "Go home to your husband, Beauty. You shouldn't be here."
},
{
"k": "10862",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "I need information to help me solve this. A desk clerk sees a lot. Keep your eyes open."
},
{
"k": "10863",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "You'll have to answer that for yourself."
},
{
"k": "10864",
"who": "BEAUTY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "[disguised voice] Sorry [cough]-sorry, sir, but you're not allowed up there."
},
{
"k": "10865",
"who": "BEAUTY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "[disguised voice] [coughs more] Sorry, but maybe call ahead next time to procure a room."
},
{
"k": "10866",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "I know it's you, Beauty."
},
{
"k": "10867",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "[Show your key]"
},
{
"k": "10868",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "I'm here on Fabletown business."
},
{
"k": "10869",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "{MockingA} {body-Hips} I know it's you, Beauty. {SarcasticA} That vanilla perfume always makes you smell like a walking cake."
},
{
"k": "10870",
"who": "BEAUTY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "[tired] {body-StandA} {ThinkingA} I hate your nose."
},
{
"k": "10871",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "Why can't I go upstairs?"
},
{
"k": "10872",
"who": "BEAUTY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "[disguised voice] I'm sorry, sir, [cough] but unless you have a key, it's not allowed."
},
{
"k": "10873",
"who": "BEAUTY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "[sheepishly] Okay."
},
{
"k": "10874",
"who": "BEAUTY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "Alright, give me a break."
},
{
"k": "10875",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "Who's there?"
},
{
"k": "10876",
"who": "BEAUTY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "[disguised voice] [cough; shocked] Nobody! [coughs] I mean, you know, we've never met. It doesn't matter."
},
{
"k": "10877",
"who": "BEAUTY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "[sheepishly] You knew it was me, right?"
},
{
"k": "10878",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "Good try, though."
},
{
"k": "10879",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_openarms",
"en": "[feigning surprise] Beauty? Oh my God, it's you!"
}
]